  {/* Content */}
  <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none">
    <p class="text-lg text-secondary leading-relaxed">
      A free, source-available macOS app cleaner for complete application uninstallation, orphaned file search, and system cleanup.
    </p>
    
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-primary mt-8 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
      Key Features
    </h2>
    <ul class="space-y-2 text-secondary">
      <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
        <span class="text-accent">-</span>
        <span>Complete app uninstall with orphaned file search</span>
      </li>
      <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
        <span class="text-accent">-</span>
        <span>Drag/drop, CLI support, and deep link automation</span>
      </li>
      <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
        <span class="text-accent">-</span>
        <span>Finder Extension for right-click uninstall</span>
      </li>
      <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
        <span class="text-accent">-</span>
        <span>Prune unused translations and strip unneeded architectures</span>
      </li>
      <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
        <span class="text-accent">-</span>
        <span>Sentinel Monitor: automatic cleanup when apps hit Trash (~2MB RAM)</span>
      </li>
      <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
        <span class="text-accent">-</span>
        <span>Theme system with custom colors</span>
      </li>
    </ul>
    
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-primary mt-8 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
      Requirements
    </h2>
    <p class="text-secondary">
      Full Disk permission required for file search. Privileged Helper needed for system folder operations. Supports macOS 13.0 (Ventura) and later.
    </p>
    
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-primary mt-8 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
      Project Status
    </h2>
    <p class="text-secondary">
      Development is currently on hold since end of 2025 due to developer's new job and lack of access to Mac development hardware. The app remains functional and available for download.
    </p>
    
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-primary mt-8 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
      Installation
    </h2>
    <pre class="bg-surface-secondary p-4 rounded-lg font-mono text-sm"><code># Homebrew
brew install --cask pearcleaner</code></pre>
